estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Gate passes with the declared picomatch waiver and refuses every malformed, expired, over-long or runtime-covering waiver; both feeds are matched exactly; notice mode reports the window, invalid records and a closed owner; 100% coverage of the advisory and notice scripts; docs describe the waiver contract"
parent: pm-03q389
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "config/dependency-advisory-waivers.json, scripts/release/dependency-advisories/waivers.mjs and receipt version 2 implement exact advisory/package/version waivers with owner, reason and a 30-day maximum expiry; malformed, duplicate, expired, over-long and runtime-covering waivers refuse; both feeds are matched exactly; verdicts disclose waived and unused waivers and refusals name the uncovered advisory; defect-evidence-gate --waiver-notice judges the same file, the notice window and an open owner; 100% coverage of the changed scripts; docs/DEVELOPMENT_DEPENDENCY_SECURITY.md documents the contract."
expected_result: "The dependency advisory gate accepts only exact, live, owned waivers outside the published runtime graph, and the notice gate warns before expiry"
actual_result: "Gate passes with the picomatch waiver, refuses every malformed, expired, over-long or runtime-covering waiver, and notice mode reports window, invalid records and a closed owner"
